A spectacular song off of And Then Nothing... and definitely one of my faves from YLT.
A thing I would say to watch out for is the timing of the chord changes, as the timing
is different with every verse and Chorus.

First off, the actual guitar part of the song is a simple one-note riff played
throughout the whole song:
